    rdf:value "religion for hours. He is becoming a Catholic again - under the influence of Mme. de Montebello, whose silly, silly arguments and prejudices he recited with a sort of sacrosanct air. It made me really dislike him, for a time – not that he should be a Catholic – ça m’est égal – but that he should use such foolish arguments about it. However, the real Placci came out when he said he would begin to fast at once except that it would give such pleasure to his family! He also amused us by repeating what were evidently Mme. de Montebello’s views of Jews, how they are taught to hate Christians, and do not consider adultery with a Christian woman a sin, though it would be an awful one with a  Placci came up to lunch, and we talked [0098] religion for hours. He is becoming a Catholic again - under the influence of Mme. de Montebello, whose silly, silly arguments and prejudices he recited with a sort of sacrosanct air. It made me really dislike him, for a time – not that he should be a Catholic – ça m’est égal – but that he should use such foolish arguments about it. However, the real Placci came out when he said he would begin to fast at once except that it would give such pleasure to his family! He also amused us by repeating what were evidently Mme. de Montebello’s views of Jews, how they are taught to hate Christians, and do not consider adultery with a Christian woman a sin, though it would be an awful one with a "^^xsd:string ;
